window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What do you do when your fated mate is dead, and you don't know where you are?</b></p> <p>With one of the four Princes fallen, and Mara whisked off in a whirl of shadows by the Nightmare King, Dominic, Tiernan, and Forrest are left behind with Jean to try and work out their next steps.</p> <p>Mara is on a quest to get back what she has lost and see the prophecy through to its conclusion. She isn't sure she can take losing anyone else, and she doesn't know how to get through this without a fight.</p> <p><i>Enjoy the conclusion to the Wyldthorn Academy series today!</i></p>"; 
